            </note>
            <note corresp="#d10-f4" n="3" xml:id="d10-f4-content">
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Infra</hi>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d10-f5" n="4" xml:id="d10-f5-content">
                <p>Henry F. Grady, Ambassador to India. In June 1946, he had been appointed
                    alternate for the Secretary of State on the Cabinet Committee on Palestine and
                    Related Problems; see footnote 78, <ref target="frus1946v07#pg_631">
